secret-tunnel-note-syndicate-stamp = SYNDICATE LOGISTICS
secret-tunnel-note-pirate-stamp = The Black Spot

secret-tunnel-note-syndicate =
    {""}[color=#850000][head=2]SYNDICATE LOGISTICS[/head][/color]
    {""}[color=#850000][bold]TOP SECRET[/bold][/color]
    {""}[bold]Syndicate intelligence reports.[/bold]

    A closed FTL route has been set up for you through the planet:

    {""}[head=2][color=#c83737]"{ $planet }"[/color][/head]

    {""}[bullet]Use it to enter and leave the NT sector.
    {""}[bullet]The way in only opens next to this planet, and you have to come back to the same spot.
    {""}[bullet]Show this letter to no one and do not say the planet's name.

    {""}[italic][color=#850000]BURN THIS LETTER AFTER READING.[/color][/italic]

secret-tunnel-note-pirate =
    {""}[bold][head=2]Landlubbers![/head][/bold]

    We found the [bold]Frontier[/bold] sector close by. The trail to it runs through the planet:

    {""}[head=2][color=#7a1f1f]"{ $planet }"[/color][/head]

    {""}[bullet]Fly up to it and the secret passage will open.
    {""}[bullet]You can only come back with the loot the same way.
    {""}[bullet]Get moving and [bold]loot some goods![/bold]

    {""}[italic]Whoever blabs gets fed to the sharks.[/italic]

ent-SecretTunnelNoteSyndicate = syndicate intelligence letter
    .desc = A folded letter marked with the red "Syndicate Logistics" stamp.
ent-SecretTunnelNotePirate = crumpled note
    .desc = A crumpled note covered in rough handwriting.
